Welcome to My VirtualBox SOC Home Lab

**Status:** In Progress

Objective

The objective of this project is to build my own virtual lab environment using Oracle VirtualBox for cybersecurity learning and practice.

In this documentation, I will walk through the process of setting up my Home Lab, including installing and configuring the necessary applications, setting up the virtual network, and completing the overall lab environment.

Project Scope

This project focuses **only on setting up and configurating** my VirtualBox Home Lab. I will document the steps I followed, the configurations I applied, and the challenges I encountered along the way.
